# BLAKE3-256 connectionsDigest pins for cloister/connections/v1 canonical documents.
#
# connectionsDigest names the canonical bytes of one connections document
# (README "Canonical form") and nothing else: not confinementDigest, not a
# blob hash, not an arena or store root. Distinct from VECTORS.sha256, which
# is a SHA-256 content-integrity pin. Line shape mirrors sha256sum.
# Verified by tests/verify_connections_digest.rs, against both the Rust
# parser and the independent Python reference (ref-impl-py/).

